e state of texas doing the  job they were elected to do  another completely different story with  them  contracting the virus and showing up at  the white house and uh  having access to nancy pelosi and others  on capitol hill now a staffer of nancy  pelosi's has tested positive  and a staffer at the white house i want  to ask you about the border crisis we  have seen the numbers governor  they are staggering we've seen the  images  of these migrants flowing over our  southern border  brand new numbers out show that that is  still at a record high  obviously coronavirus also playing a  part here as we are now learning a large  percentage of those migrants  are now reporting that they do and are  carrying coronavirus  over the southern border what are you  doing about  a wall can you really build one  no we can and i will mention that but  let me first touch upon the last thing  that you said and that is  as we're speaking the president is  considering lifting title 42 that  president trump put in place which was  to prevent people coming  into texas from mexico or coming into  the united states from mexico  because of the kova situation it is  going to be  a disastrous political and policy  decision if the president lifts that  the president bears personal  responsibility for every single american  who gets  sick or contracts covey because of  people coming across the border  and and he needs to be called out on  being so reckless  in considering lifting title 42 with  regard to your other point  listen we've already begun the process  of building the border wall as well as  adding barriers  with regard to building the border wall  we're under the process of hiring a  project manager  we are already receiving offers and  information  from those who've already been involved  in building the border wall showing the  ways that we're going to be able to  build it  we've already we've already made an  allocation of funding by the state  legislature  we will be adding to 